,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,545,0,10,1Style: Judge-furigana,LightningBlaze,27.5,&H0054BFE7,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,0,2,120,120,18,1Style: Sanji-furigana,BlackChancery,27.5,&H008BEEF0,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,0,2,120,120,18,1Style: Narrator-furigana,Impress BT,28,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0.75,0.75,8,120,120,18,1Style: Narrator,Impress BT,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,8,120,120,18,1Style: Sanji,BlackChancery,55,&H008BEEF0,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,120,120,18,1Style: Judge,LightningBlaze,55,&H0054BFE7,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,120,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.92,Title,,0,0,240,,UnprecedentedDialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:12.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, you guys. I forgot about something.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:13.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take these with you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Aren't those Devil Fruits?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:27.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:32.20,Main,,0,0,0,,true?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen them before!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:38.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Me neither!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Keep those away from me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the big fuss, Jabra?Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't you know?Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Those with Devil fruit powers have a devil dwelling inside their bodies!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,For example, if I get close to a fruit,Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:03:02.84,Main,,0,0,0,,a devil will jump out and start fighting  the devil in me, causing my body to explode!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that true?Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How foolish...Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It takes a sloppy intelligence agent to be misled by a rumor.Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:19.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Grand Line scientists have already discovered how the Fruits transfer their powers.Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're talking about when someone eats two Fruits.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,They die because their body  disintegrates without a trace.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Greedy idiots bring ruin upon themselves.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If they think about the risk that they carry with just one fruit,Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,you'd think that they could guess how much of a curse the second one would bring them.Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that so?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm surprised that you were able to obtain two Devil Fruits, Chief.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Where on earth did you get them?Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I have all sorts of connections.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat them to prepare for the future.Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Become stronger, CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:59.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you one thing.Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:03.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of devils dwell in those Fruits.Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that these are Fruits from this world.Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel a mysterious power, kind of like gravity, from them.Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:12.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not listed in encyclopedias, either.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That seems to be how they normally are.Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It's said that you can tell the name of the fruit from the powers you gain,Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:22.30,Main,,0,0,0,,but what kind of powers you'll gain is a gamble.Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be a terrible life if you gain weird powers with this gamble.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:30.97,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, to think that you'll become unable to swim...Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what powers they are, it all depends on how you use them.Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.18,Main,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, you won't become weaker.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:40.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Being unable to swim is no drawback, either.Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:47.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Countless sailors find death in their quest for just one Devil Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat them.  I'm curious to see what you'll become.Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Kalifa, don't do it! Nothing good will come of this.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It tastes like crap. Crap!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Jabra doesn't want Kaku and Kalifa to get stronger.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Your jealousy tarnishes your name.Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two! Think about it carefully!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Find the right buyer, and they'd be worth several hundred million Belly!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,One bite will ruin your life!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds interesting.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:48.11,Main,,0,0,0,,If this is a winner, I'll welcome it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.03,Main,,0,0,0,,They ate them, damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed any changes in your body?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting.Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have said that sooner?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It tastes terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already heard that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:31.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that after you ate the whole thing!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, try doing something! What kind of powers did you get?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like anything changed.Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll soon notice how big the change is.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the birth of new Devil Fruit power-holders.Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing them.Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Get a handle on your own powers at least, while you have a chance.Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Depending on the chief's command,Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,you may be able to try them in a real battle immediately...Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,though it seems that Blueno couldn't wait, and joined the festivities before us.Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:05.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:05.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:05.88,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:05.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:05.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:06.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:06.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:06.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:06.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:06.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:06.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:06.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialog