s,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:09.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:09.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:09.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:09.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:09.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:09.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:09.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:09.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:09.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:09.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:09.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:09.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:09.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:10.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:26.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I never thought that he'd keep up with the speed of Shave.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I should be careful.Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:31.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Since he's a rubber man, hitting him wouldn't work, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Wheel!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:59.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Door-Door!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A door just opened on the ground!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Door-Door.Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?! Were there small doors here?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:19.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! I got stuck! Dammit! These things...Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:23.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You! What's this?! What'd you do?! Is this a Devil Fruit power?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:25.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a door human with Door-Door Devil Fruit powers.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:29.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I can turn anything into a door!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Revolving Door.Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What?! Wh-What's going on?! I feel dizzy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Which way is forward?! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cook!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy's already fighting CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is that true?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! We got off to a late start!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,But how do we break out of this encirclement?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone hit Gomorrah with a flail, and he can't move!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Shoot those pirates down from that beast!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,There's only one way out!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're gonna make a dash for the courthouse!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the only choice we have.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:35.25,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:37.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:37.35,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody get off!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah... Gomorrah says so!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The monster is...Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Use the RPGs to take it down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot the monster!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Fight back! Back up Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gomorrah! Why are you slamming into walls?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on? So he can't go on after all?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:02.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not it! He can't see!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,His eyesight has weakened, because his retinas got hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You can't see?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It started running like crazy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep them encircled! Stop the monster!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:22.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?! Fire the trench mortars already!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:30.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to keep running anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He says that he promised Sodom!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He told Sodom: "Leave the rest to me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:46.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll carry everyone for you!"Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.64,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Gomorrah...Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:55.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They were inside its stomach?Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:59.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't eat anymore. I'm full.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:01.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's take them back with us for emergency food.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:08.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bro! There's trouble! Some pirates beat up Sodom and Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:12.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve messing with my underlings!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're injured! Don't dance! Sodom! Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:33.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a dead end ahead! He'll crash into it and die!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:36.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah! Stop! Don't run blindly!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Dead end? Do you see one?Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Nope... I don't see anything like that.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the courthouse, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.82,0:13:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We made it! Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,This report is for all units!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:43.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The King Bull the pirates were riding on  broke through the encirclement in Block D!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:39.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:39.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:39.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:39.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:39.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:39.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:39.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:39.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:39.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:39.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:39.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:39.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:39.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:39.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:39.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:39.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:39.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:39.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.93,0:13:39.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:40.01,Captions,,0,0,0