0,0:13:42.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:42.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:42.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:42.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:42.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:42.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:42.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:43.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:43.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:43.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:43.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:43.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:43.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:43.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:43.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:43.27,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:43.27,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They've just reached the courthouse plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I repeat! The pirates...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this... Funkfreed.Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a Golden Transponder Snail.Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,This glittering Transponder Snail is indeed a valuable item.Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Only those with permission from at least a Navy admiral can have one,Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:10.39,Main,,0,0,0,,as it gives the authority  to excercise a Buster Call.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In order for me to exercise a Buster Call, Aokiji temporarily entrusted it to me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see! Once the revival of the weapon becomes reality,Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to carry this myself,  instead of having some admiral entrust it to me,Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:30.07,Main,,0,0,0,,and control troops at will.Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:39.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Just by pressing this button, an entire island can be wiped out.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.79,0:14:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Authority can be like a weapon too, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.66,0:14:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?! Knock on the door first!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost accidentally pressed the button!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry. But I was told that this is an emergency.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.56,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a call from Enies Lobby's main island.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! A call?!  They should've called this room directly!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! The receiver is off the hook!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:13.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Who keeps doing that?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:17.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? You just said that there's an emergency or something, right?Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Spanda!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,There's apparently an emergency report from Enies Lobby's main island.Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's probably not a real emergency, but you can probably guess what it's about, right?Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Straw Hat Luffy, who worked hard to beat up a whole five soldiers...Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:16:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,How your friends got stomped by  the strongest gatekeepers, Oimo and Kashi...Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's listen together and hear what happened to the idiots who rebelled against the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a real scumbag!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you punk!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guard!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Spandam.Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this the chief?! Good! I can finally give you a report!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know where to start.Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you idiot!  You wanna talk about the Straw Hats, right?Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened after the last report? Oh, wait! Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,In your report, just briefly summarize  the key points and speak loud and clear!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! The invaders-Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,, Did you accidentally kill them?Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's their own fault for being so weak-Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates, who number about sixty,Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,have invaded and pushed into the courthouse plaza,Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:17:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,the farthest point in Enies Lobby's main island.Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,To all units on Enies Lobby's main island!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,All soldiers! Head to the courthouse plaza immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You did a good job, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't waste the effort  you and your brother made for us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:27.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna attack, guys! We'll rescue Big Bro Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates have reached the courthouse plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you see Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If the rooftop is that high, we can't just climb up there.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,No... It's not like we're made of rubber.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:01.23,Main,,0,0,0,,How many CP9 members did you see?Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We only saw the big horn guy.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that all of them are in a place like that with Robin-chan and Franky.Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to catch up with Luffy quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry and rescue Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the courthouse plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:20.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge isn't down yet! Corner them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What an amazing frog!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the flail that knocked out Gomorrah! Whose is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Over there! They're running away! There are three of them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they running away? They're the ones who started the attack.Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! It's a waste of time chasing after each enemy who runs away!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up. I just went to check.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't hurt to know what kind of enemies would attack us, would it?Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He brought him down!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,He must have incredible strength to swing around something like this!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he belong to a special unit like the Watchdogs?Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,There may be more hiding!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:43.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful.Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry up. The guards are closing in on us.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Corner them!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna be able to open the courthouse's heavy stone doors anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Finish them here in the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:20:00.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, these doors are huge.Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,How will we...Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,get them open...?Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Get a move on! I'll go on ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He cut through that thick stone!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Zambai!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll split up and go to both sides in order to pull down the drawbridge's levers!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay! I'm counting on you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! We'll split into three groups!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Come with me to clean up the courthouse!  I only need a few of you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck, guys! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:45.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:45.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:45.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:45.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:45.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:45.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:4