,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:48.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:48.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:48.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:48.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:48.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:48.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:48.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:48.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:48.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:48.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:48.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:48.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:48.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:48.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:48.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:48.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:48.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:48.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:49.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:49.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:49.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:49.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.07,0:20:49.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.07,0:20:49.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.11,0:20:49.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.11,0:20:49.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:49.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:49.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:49.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:49.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:49.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:49.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:49.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:49.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:49.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:49.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:49.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:49.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:49.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:49.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:49.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:49.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:49.57,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:49.57,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:49.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:49.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:49.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:49.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tower of JusticeDialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, the Giant gatekeepers at the main island's front gate, Oimo and Kashi, went over to the pirates' side!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:21:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,They're currently around the center of the main island running towards the courthouse!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Get outta our way!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The casualties of our guards are...Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:13.82,Main,,0,0,0,,over 2000!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:16.27,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Not five...?Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And the captain, Straw Hat Luffy,  who beat over 1000 all by himself,Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,suddenly disappeared, so we're searching for him right now!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:33.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is probably unprecedented - the worst situation we've had in the history of Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Blueno...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing in a place like that?Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening on this island right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Baskerville! Chief Justice Baskerville! Come in! It's me!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Chief Spandam!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:00.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:00.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:00.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:00.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:00.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:00.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:00.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:00.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:00.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Left Baskerville on the left!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Right Baskerville on the right!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,And in the center, I am "All Alone Traveling the Central Main Line"!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.53,0:22:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me a status report!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that the pirates have already made it to the courthouse plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.41,0:22:20.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Status?Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Status...Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,As for the status...Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.59,0:22:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,More than the plaza, the inside of the courthouse is...Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,in the most terrible state!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chief Justice! I have a report!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates cut through the giant stone doors  and entered the courhtouse!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:53.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see that already, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd see more enemies in here.Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:23:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like the way is clear, but what the heck is that?Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! His head...!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He's like that guard dog from hell I heard about in some story!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:08.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Berberus?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:10.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean Cerberus!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.13,0:23:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Men! Order!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a sacred chamber of law!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll now cast judgment on your inevitable fate!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, head to the rooftop where Straw Hat is!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,A group of us along with Yokozuna will stop pursuers at the doors.Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got your back, so keep pushing forward!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that. Looks like the trial has started.Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.41,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Their crime is as follows!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:42.56,Secondary,,0,0,0,,First, the act of stepping into Enies Lobby,Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Ignore it. It's just a bother! Which way do we go?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:45.11,Secondary,,0,0,0,,which belongs to the World Government, is...Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead! There are stairs on both sides!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take them to the upper floors!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.63,0:23:47.78,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:53.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! How rude! They ignored our sacred trial!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.07,0:23:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's unforgivable!  How dare they mock the judicial island?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:58.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Die!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:06.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?  His swords look like they're bending!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Charming Demon Sleepless Night...Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.85,0:24:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Oni Giri!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.45,0:24:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he the one who cut open the door?Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go. The path is now open!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:30.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep!Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.12,0:24:37.30,Main,,0,0,0,,So why is a guy who's that strong not their captain?Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.38,0:24:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait! Outta my way! Reindeer! Moron swordsman!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.40,0:24:44.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Suit guy...Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.97,0:24:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a dangerous enemy camp!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll clear the path for Nami-san to move forward! Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:51.39,Main,,0,0,0,,– Whoa! – Hey, watch it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.39,0:24:53.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why is he starting a fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.33,0:24:57.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Are you picking a fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.15,0:25:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You bastards are not to get in Nami-san's way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san, this way! Follow only me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.04,0:25:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, we came to rescue Robin, right?Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's right, Robin-chan is waiting for me to rescue her!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Could she be crying right now out of loneliness?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.92,0:25:17.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously...Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:18.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:21.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We take our eyes off Zoro for a second, and now he's...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.82,0:25:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zoro! That's the wrong way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:30.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I said the stairs! Just what made you think you should go that way?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.23,0:25:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What fantasy world are you in?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:34.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! It was because you didn't explain it well!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.22,0:25:35.91,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way it was my fault!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:39.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro, I'll try making some medicine...Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.74,0:25:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,something that cures the oblivious.Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oblivious...? Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.86,0:25:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.78,0:25:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.25,0:25:46.94,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan! I'm coming now!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.25,0:25:46.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure it works on that guy, too.Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:49.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Er... Yeah, okay, got it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:52.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Big Bro will be rescued safely.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the type that gets it together when the going gets tough...Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:26:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,probably... I'm sure... yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.23,0:26:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a big crime.Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a huge crime.Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll pick the one in the middle...Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The death penalty!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Agreed!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:15.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the Chief Justice. Don't ignore me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.65,0:26:31.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper. Nami. Go on ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.36,0:26:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you after I take care of this guy.Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you can defeat me? What a cocky pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.07,0:26:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll show you how terrifying I can...Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.87,0:26:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:27:06.06,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho...!Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.37,0:27:02.96,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop...Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take you on, Cerberus!Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.24,0:27:16.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky Family!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.07,0:27:18.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.94,0:27:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.39,Main,,0,0,0,,My face door finally closed!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course. An opened door is meant to close.Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you could dodge my Tempest Kick.Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.92,0:27:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, it's a piece of cake.Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.63,0:27:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I resent that.Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.54,0:27:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He jumped!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.61,0:28:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.76,0:28:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body Smash!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.28,0:28:08.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Bullet!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.55,0:28:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.27,0:28:17.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.81,0:28:32.20,Main,,0,0,0,,He's keeping up with me.Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He altered my Tempest Kick's course.Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.55,0:28:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He's got unbelievable physical abilities!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.57,0:28:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,This won't do.Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.72,0:28:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.97,0:28:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm no good like this.Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.73,0:28:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,When I lost to Aokiji, I thought...Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:52.90,Main,,0,0,0,,"If run into guys this powerful on the sea ahead,Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.90,0:28:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to protect my friends...Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:28:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,unless I get much stronger."Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.78,0:29:06.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I want my friends by my side even if some of them are not at that level.Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got to be stronger, or I'll lose them all.Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... what're you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.63,0:29:18.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I came up with a way to fight with all my might...Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.37,0:29:21.37,Main,,0,0,0,,so that I won't lose anyone...Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.68,0:29:26.64,Main,,0,0,0,,So that no one will be taken away from me.Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:31.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing? What's happening inside his body?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.39,0:29:35.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, you...Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,are no match for me...Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:39.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.53,0:29:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,All my other abilities are now on another level.Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.35,0:29:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.71,0:29:52.90,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: KaitouYahiko, Lance  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 2,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.49,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,seDi